		title: "Track Enemy Status With Health and Shield Bars",
		metaDescription: "Health and shield bars on ESP show base HP versus Regenerative Shields. Season 9 recovery rules and when to finish a target in Marvel Rivals.",
		h1: "Track Every Enemy's Status with Precision Health and Shield Bars",
		intro: "A grey box does not tell you if the Vanguard is one shot or sitting on a full Regenerative Shield. Health and shield bars split those pools so you stop dumping clips into a tank who will refill behind a wall.",
