		faq: [{"question":"What is the difference between health and Regenerative Shields?","answer":"Both take damage the same way. Shields refill if the hero avoids damage for five seconds, then fill over the next five. Base health does not do that on its own."},{"question":"Why did Team-Up Anchor bonus health go away?","answer":"Season 9 removed flat Team-Up Anchor HP pads. Pools now come from base stats, Regenerative Shields, and specific partner effects. The bar overlay has to show the real split."},{"question":"Should I always finish a regenerating tank?","answer":"If they reached cover, you already lost the burst. Swap to the Strategist or the cart. Do not farm a shield that is about to snap back."},{"question":"Do ally bars matter too?","answer":"Yes for peels. In-game allied health through walls exists as a vanilla toggle. ESP bars add enemies and the shield split the HUD does not give you."}]
