		h1: "Look Natural While Dominating: Configuring Aim Smoothing Controls",
		intro: "Smoothing is how fast the assist closes the gap. Zero smoothing is a teleport to the head. High smoothing is a slow glide. Aim smoothing controls exist so the path looks like a mouse, not a macro.",
		keywords: ["aim smoothing","smooth aim","marvel rivals aimbot smoothing","humanized aim","tracking smoothness"],
